@baseUrl = https://www.gamerpower.com/api

### All active giveaways, unfiltered — see the full raw shape once
GET {{baseUrl}}/giveaways

### Games only, PC platforms — likely what the cron actually queries
GET {{baseUrl}}/giveaways?type=game&platform=pc

### Single giveaway by ID (once we have one from the above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/giveaway?id=525

### No active giveaways sanity check — total $ value, cheap way to see if anything's live
GET {{baseUrl}}/worth?platform=pc&type=game